00:09:53.522 --> 00:09:55.426
"You got to create the kind of energy

00:09:55.426 --> 00:09:56.523
that you want in your life".

00:09:56.523 --> 00:09:59.094
If you constantly keep creating
positive energy around you,

00:09:59.094 --> 00:10:00.658
then more positive things will come.

00:10:00.658 --> 00:10:02.755
So, I would be landing all these jobs.

00:10:02.755 --> 00:10:05.050
I never was one that
let my record stop me,

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.167
my criminal record

00:10:06.167 --> 00:10:08.748
