'cause I was just working.

00:10:09.991 --> 00:10:12.075
I was working two or
three jobs at one time.

00:10:12.075 --> 00:10:15.017
At one point, I worked
at Demo in the mall,

00:10:15.017 --> 00:10:16.607
Paragon Solutions, the
telemarketing agency

00:10:16.607 --> 00:10:19.968
