00:10:19.968 --> 00:10:21.000
It's like a psychic telling you,

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.855
"Yo, you going to be rich one day".

00:10:22.855 --> 00:10:24.800
So, you just sit around
and wait to be rich.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.064
It don't work like that.

00:10:26.064 --> 00:10:29.168
When you're constantly thinking
about doing positive things,

00:10:29.168 --> 00:10:30.343
you got to actually go out there and

00:10:30.343 --> 00:10:31.616
be working towards those goals.

00:10:31.616 --> 00:10:33.376
That's why I told you
earlier about just going out

00:10:33.376 --> 00:10:35.921
and working at Taco Bell,
or working at a warehouse,

00:10:35.921 --> 00:10:37.671
just trying to create that positive energy

00:10:37.671 --> 00:10:40.004
and production into my life.

