00:11:19.288 --> 00:11:21.705
Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:11:27.962 --> 00:11:29.346
- I don't have all the answers.

00:11:29.346 --> 00:11:31.018
I just have my experiences.

00:11:31.018 --> 00:11:32.154
I'm not an expert of nothing,

00:11:32.154 --> 00:11:33.303
I only know what I've been through

00:11:33.303 --> 00:11:37.262
and what I've lived and things
that I've adapted to my life

00:11:37.262 --> 00:11:38.337
that have caused me to prosper,

00:11:38.337 --> 00:11:41.420
so I'm trying to give that to people.

00:11:43.502 --> 00:11:44.961
I don't believe in good or bad.

00:11:44.961 --> 00:11:47.112
I just believe in the process.

00:11:47.112 --> 00:11:47.945
- Yes.

00:11:47.945 --> 00:11:49.992
- I don't believe that
there's ever been anything

00:11:49.992 --> 00:11:51.352
necessarily good that's happened to me,

00:11:51.352 --> 00:11:53.392
I don't believe there's
anything that's been necessarily

00:11:53.392 --> 00:11:54.225
bad that's happened to me,

00:11:54.225 --> 00:11:55.311
it's just all part of the process.

00:11:55.311 --> 00:11:57.199
It's this thing called The Rule of Ten.

00:11:57.199 --> 00:11:59.001
The Rule of Ten is three
people are going to like it,

00:11:59.001 --> 00:12:00.463
three people are not going to like it

00:12:00.463 --> 00:12:03.111
and four people are just going
to be on the fence about it.

00:12:03.111 --> 00:12:04.607
They're just going to remain neutral

00:12:04.607 --> 00:12:06.735
and just wait to see what happens.

00:12:06.735 --> 00:12:10.595
I used that whenever I
say anything in life,

00:12:10.595 --> 00:12:12.361
or however I approach
anything, like a TV show,

00:12:12.361 --> 00:12:14.351
or the radio show for that day,

00:12:14.351 --> 00:12:16.439
or a statement I might make.

00:12:16.439 --> 00:12:18.559
There's three people who
are going to agree with it,

00:12:18.559 --> 00:12:19.879
three people are not and

00:12:19.879 --> 00:12:21.087
four people are just going
to be on the fence about it.

00:12:21.087 --> 00:12:23.753
So, you just have to take all
of that into consideration

00:12:23.753 --> 00:12:25.031
and that goes into something

00:12:25.031 --> 00:12:26.279
my father told me a long time ago.

00:12:26.279 --> 00:12:28.663
My father said, "You're never
as good as they say you are

00:12:28.663 --> 00:12:31.304
and you're never as bad
as they say you are".

00:12:31.304 --> 00:12:34.095
Personally, I just don't care either way.

00:12:34.095 --> 00:12:38.012
The only thing I can do
is be authentically me.

